 "title": "Microbiota and Gene Expression in Dezhou Jennies",
 "summary": "This cluster focuses on the microbiota and gene expression of Dezhou jennies, an organism. The jennies are fed a basal diet supplemented with yeast hydrolysate and also fed MCON and MYE. Their microbiota includes Arcanobacterium, Bacillota, and Bacteroidota. Gene expression is detected in response to heat ramp and heat shock processes, both of which are affected by nutrient limitation. The ComBat method requires ANOVA, Levene’s test, R, and iDEP to function. WGCNA uses ComBat, and RStudio identified the results of ANOVA and used R. Gene Expression Omnibus studied BY4742, and GSE276309 has BY4742 as a subject. Table S6 contains DEGs, which are also detected in heat ramp and heat shock processes.",
